[{"op":"background","image":"bg033"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",316],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个人走在熟悉的街道上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"周围已经没有穿同样校服的人了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过这也很正常，因为第一节课已经开始了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对我来说，穿着校服的人热热闹闹地走在这条路上的场景反而更少见。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要不就干脆别去学校了，直接溜了吧…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"反正去了也是睡觉…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过我穿着校服，让其他人看见恐怕有些不太方便…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"去春原的房间打发时间好像也挺不错…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，去教室睡的话还能混出勤…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟…。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":18,"condition":["&&",["&&",["==",255,255],["==",255,255]],["==",255,255]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"砰！！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嘎啊！！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然被什么东西撞到背上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且那冲击力还很大。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"弄得我一下喘不上气来而且眼冒金星。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我忍着疼捂着火辣辣的背回头一看──…。"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky01a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",306],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哎呀，对不起。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你…你这家伙…该不会是用这玩意撞的我…？！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊哈哈哈ー，其实我还是个新手司机啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「驾照也是上周刚拿到的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「当然是一次就过关的。所以就买了新车哦，新车♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「怎么样？很酷对吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「先诚心诚意道歉之后再炫耀行不行！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哎？我不是一开始就说『对不起』了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那就是你的诚意吗？用通俗一点的实物来道歉行吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「去翻翻字典什么叫赔偿金！」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky01b"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",500],"value":0},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你这是什么话嘛，谁让你大摇大摆地走在大街上。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「行人可是弱势群体！出这种事故你可是要被暂扣驾照的，懂么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啰里啰嗦的烦不烦哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「知道自己是弱势群体就该乖乖在路边走。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「故意去挑衅强者，输了之后又声称自己是受害者？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「真是俗到爆。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"等等，凭什么我要被说得那么不堪…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且我从没想过要去挑衅摩托。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"反而是她单方追尾，我这１００％是受害者啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…行吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「怎么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我要报警，说这里发生了伤人交通事故。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「且不论原因如何，你肯定是会被暂扣驾照的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「老老实实去上一整天的交规培训吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你敢这么做我就碾死你哦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"眼神没有开玩笑的意思…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说着玩的。」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky01c"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",500],"value":0},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我是认真的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我猜也是…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…对了…你怎么这么晚了还在这里呀？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「而且骑摩托上学是校规禁止的吧。」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky01a"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",500],"value":0},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就是因为时间来不及了才骑摩托的嘛。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「人又不多，我又赶时间，骑这个多轻松。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「反正都迟到了，再快还不是一回事？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那种惰性思维会让人堕落哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「为了图轻松就骑摩托上学难道就不是惰性么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「交通工具是人类智慧的结晶。文明的关键点，要善加利用才会有意义。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"荒唐透顶的借口…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你好歹带带我呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这是单人摩托。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「挤一挤不就可以座两个人了嘛。」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky01c"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",500],"value":0},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「怎么？难不成你…想抱我？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「能抱吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「能啊，不过之后你就只吃流食了哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊，是我会打碎你下巴的意思。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我听得懂不用解释得那么清楚！」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky01a"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",500],"value":0},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那么，我要走了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，也是。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg033"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我绕到杏的摩托后面，坐在尾翼上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「走起！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咣！！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毫不留情地用头盔砸中了我的下巴。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「很痛的！」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky01b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你往哪儿坐呢！要是尾翼坐断了信不信我砸碎你的鼻子！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不是说只要不抱你就没事了吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那你就两手举高高坐在垫子上。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那会被甩出去的！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我不会骑那么快的啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你往前再挪点。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「真是的…你先下去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「行，听你的。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg033"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我艰难地从尾翼上下来站在摩托旁。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好了，快挪点位子出──…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，就这么扔下我不管了啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊哈哈哈哈，你太天真啦，蠢货。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随着杏渐渐远去，她的骂声也越来越小声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「下次再让我看见那台车我就往钥匙孔里塞口香糖！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"本已远去的杏突然一个甩尾掉头过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后向我直冲过来…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"砰！"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「痛死了！」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky01b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…你要这么做了，我就拿一次性筷子插进你的指甲缝。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我会铭记于心的…」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg033"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏恐吓已经倒地的我，接着又是一个甩尾掉头径直走掉了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这家伙做些事可真不是闹着玩的…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这一次我望着她的摩托尾灯真的远去后，才叹气说到…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说来藤林的占卜…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"通过火热的冲击遇到温柔的女性…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"身心都焕然一新…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…哼…江湖骗子…。"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgry14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"椋","text":"「那个…唔…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgry14a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"椋","text":"「怎，怎么了…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊～…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我慢慢撑起身来面向藤林。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你那姐姐可真是了不得。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgry15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"椋","text":"「…唉？姐姐…吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，她今天也迟到了吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgry21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"椋","text":"「是，是的…一直叫不醒她…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「来的路上遇到她了，骑个机──…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgry15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"椋","text":"「…怎么了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不…感觉好像脑袋被什么给砸了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgry16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"椋","text":"「…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不管了，杏那家伙早上用机──…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「……？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgry15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"椋","text":"「…冈崎君…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦哦，不好意思…我被她用机──…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我被机──…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgry16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我机──…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚…咚…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"学生","text":"「喂，你听到了吗？冈崎那家伙好像是基呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"学生","text":"「双向插头吗，这么强的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「说谁呢！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"学生","text":"「坏了坏了，他朝这边看了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"学生","text":"「赶紧捂住菊花当心被爆了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怕你们不成啊！有种跟我去厕所！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"学生","text":"「听到没，他说要去厕所呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"学生","text":"「这可是来真的呀…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgry19a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"椋","text":"「…冈崎君…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「等等，藤林，你似乎产生了某种危险的误会！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgry21a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"椋","text":"「我…我也听说过有这类人…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想说的是！我被杏用机──…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然一声脆响。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有个东西飞了过来…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然不怎么疼吧，但那声响确实刺耳。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后『那玩意』噗的一下掉在我的腿上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原来是橡皮擦…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎是这玩意的平面部分恰好砸中了我的额头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这块橡皮有不少缺口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道刚才咚咚咚砸我的就是这玩意的碎渣吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…话说…！"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",323],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这谁扔的！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰啦…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我刚站起来喊，杏就同时从教室门口气势汹汹地冲进来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紧接着一把抓住我的领带，连拖带拽地把我拉出教室。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你想干嘛啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你这人！当着教室那么多人打算说什么呢！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？还能说什么，当然是说你用机车把我──…唔呃…！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我话还没说完就被她捂住了嘴。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我说你呀～，难道想害我被停学吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？为什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏皱着眉头一下搂住我的脖子，把我朝她那边拉了过去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后悄悄地对我说。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"（骑摩托上学是违反校规的，被老师发现就麻烦了。）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…那你就别骑那么危险的东西了啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"（你在说什么啊！好不容易才买的哦？当然想骑着跑啦。）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"做人不要这么利己主义吧…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"（总之，我骑摩托上学这件事…绝对要保密哦！）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…如果说漏嘴的话？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「把你眼珠挖出来塞鼻孔里。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这女的怎么回事，竟然若无其事说出这么离谱的事来…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「好了，回教室里去吧。一定要把我的事给糊弄过去哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「知道了啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我叹了口气回到了教室。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，其实啊，３-E的藤林杏有鸡鸡。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰啦！"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"拖拽！！"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你到底什么意思！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「糊弄同学？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你怎么能这样污蔑我呢？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那样下去我很危险的好吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这样不是挺好吗。偶尔危险一下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这句话原封不动还给你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「万一别人当真了怎么办！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…什么意思…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「没，没什么特别的意思啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「总而言之，如果再敢说这种话我杀了你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「知道啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我咋了一下舌头回到了教室。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不好意思，刚才是我乱说的。３-E的藤林杏，比起男人其实更喜欢女人。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰啦！"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"拖拽！！"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你ー这ー人ー啊～…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「真就那么想死吗？！我花２０分钟绞死你哦？嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你告诉我该怎么说？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「什么都别说老实坐回去不就好了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嘁…真无聊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊？你说什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「自言自语。就当我什么都没说。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"return"},{"op":"return"}]